// reverse of the signer's darkest-first order — each file keeps its
// source's true order, and its ramps match.) The source's two eye-
// placeholder paths and its stray stroke="#000" are deliberately not
// kept: eyes are replaced by the canonical <Eye/>, and outlines are
// banned (design-bible §2).
